City dataset provenance
-----------------------
- Dataset: NYC 3-D Building Model (CityGML 1.0), Grand Central Terminal area,
  extracted from delivery area tile DA12
- Publisher: NYC Office of Technology and Innovation (formerly DoITT),
  published on NYC Open Data
  (https://data.cityofnewyork.us/City-Government/3-D-Building-Model/tnru-abg2)
- Original terms: NYC Open Data Terms of Use
  (https://opendata.cityofnewyork.us/overview/)
- Attribution: NYC 3D Building Massing Model — NYC Office of Technology and
  Innovation (DoITT), NYC Open Data
- Acquired: 2026-08-21 (official DA12 distribution; the original download is
  not part of this repository)
- Coordinate reference system: EPSG:2263 (US survey feet, unchanged from the
  original)
- Stable building IDs: gen:BIN (as distributed). The placeholder value
  1000000, which repeats in the original data, is declared in
  4dcitygml.json (building_id.invalid_values); tools deterministically fall
  back to the original gml:id for those 3 buildings. The GML itself is not
  rewritten for this.

Modifications from the original distribution (changes were made):
1. Subset extraction — only the Grand Central Terminal area (974 buildings)
   of tile DA12 is included, as citygml/da12_grand_central_area.gml. Building
   contents and identifiers are unchanged by the extraction.
2. Ongoing collaborative edits — buildings are updated through reviewed pull
   requests; every change is recorded in the git history of this repository
   (per-building commits). docs/provenance-rules.md defines how sources are
   recorded inside the data.

Newly contributed images must follow docs/data-contribution-policy.md
(rights, no identifiable persons / plates, removal-request contact).

